# Per-OS base stow packages — applied for every profile on a given OS,
# regardless of profile. These are the OS keyboard-shortcut / desktop /
# window-manager dotfiles. Format: `<os>: pkg pkg pkg` (one OS per line).
# `#` comments and blank lines are ignored. The per-package gate in
# stow-os.map still applies on top of this.
omarchy: hypr waybar rofi wallpapers themes
macos: aerospace borders
